## Development

```sh
{% if 'python' in stacks %}uv sync{% if python_dir != '.' %} --directory {{ python_dir }}{% endif %}
{% endif %}{% if 'ts' in stacks %}pnpm{% if ts_dir != '.' %} -C {{ ts_dir }}{% endif %} install
{% endif %}{% if 'ts' in stacks and 'python' not in stacks %}pnpm{% if ts_dir != '.' %} -C {{ ts_dir }}{% endif %} exec prek install     # git hooks
{% else %}uv tool install prek   # once per machine
prek install     # git hooks
{% endif %}```

`just` lists the tasks. They mirror what [.github/workflows/](.github/workflows/) runs.

```sh
just check       # lint, types and tests for every stack here{% if 'docker' in stacks %}
just up          # run the service(s) in its container, rebuilt on source changes{% endif %}
```

